        "id": 187718,
        "name": "KateWalker",
        "username": "TakeWalker",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-01-04T01:01:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, that worked. Infrared Eyepiece won me that game, buried both Return With the Dawns, not to mention Aurora and Citizen Sweat. Get those Obsidian Fields out and leave 'em in play, Fanatic can do so much more damage to Dawn than she'll take. Not to mention, once the first one's in play, you don't need Chastise to keep up Zealous Offense. :) I took far too much damage that way before realizing what I was doing, and Wraith got eaten by raptors, but I finished 0-2-6!</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:13:33.274Z",
