      {
        "id": 187721,
        "name": "Melkhor",
        "username": "Melkhor",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/ad7895/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-01-04T10:37:28.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Near Mint for me as I lost the first game in the stupidest way imaginable. The -one- turn I get greedy and go for a double-strike on Dawn with Wraith instead of using the eye-piece.... and OF COURSE I get hit in the face with the Devastating Aurora! D'oh!</p>",
