      {
        "id": 187722,
        "name": "KateWalker",
        "username": "TakeWalker",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-01-04T14:16:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, don't ever not use the Eyepiece. Every round, I would find \"horrible card\" alongside \"significantly less horrible card\". An easy choice! And it took away most of Dawn's teeth.</p>",
