      {
        "id": 187725,
        "name": "deddragon",
        "username": "deddragon",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/deddragon/{size}/2335_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-01-05T01:22:59.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I got near mint because I was a fool. I had a plan for that Wrathful Retribution, but then a Raptor killed the citizen I left alive meaning that Dawn didn’t flip back. And yet for some odd reason, on Fanatic’s turn I played it anyway! Rewind!<br>\nI didn’t use the Eyepiece, but thanks to an early incapped Bunker I did use Aegis and Retribution both twice.</p>",
